   ],
   "voice": "en-IN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
   "speakingRate": 1,
   "text": "Watch closely. Some waste substances pass out of the plant, into the soil around the roots."
  },
  "soil.reason": {
   "url": "03f_soil_reason.mp3",
   "bytes": 17664,
   "sha256": "3c0c07c5b171f779b5926904af896047531cf051d035c9eded93939cd96c73b5",
   "durationMs": 4520,
   "leadInMs": 350,
   "sentenceStartsMs": [
    0
   ],
   "voice": "en-IN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
   "speakingRate": 1,
   "text": "So plants also excrete some waste substances into the soil around them."
  },
  "whole.return": {
   "url": "04_whole_return.mp3",
   "bytes": 14112,
   "sha256": "f4059a33c60092839c84f7cf554ec2e08570e9863bb20cf347ea0a0495c65601",
   "durationMs": 3480,
   "leadInMs": 350,
   "sentenceStartsMs": [
    0
   ],
   "voice": "en-IN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
   "speakingRate": 1,
   "text": "Now let’s put the whole journey together, on one plant."
  },
  "whole.oxygen": {
   "url": "04_whole_oxygen.mp3",
   "bytes": 17664,
   "sha256": "f2363217118cacc2af88d30f94fa2f656d8cfd64d02862a16bc7f48dc3412347",
   "durationMs": 4080,
   "leadInMs": 350,
   "sentenceStartsMs": [
    0
   ],
   "voice": "en-IN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
   "speakingRate": 1,
   "text": "From the leaves, oxygen made in photosynthesis is released into the air."
  },
  "whole.water": {
   "url": "04_whole_water.mp3",
   "bytes": 20256,
   "sha256": "dcef8e97884a41c058d1e1c2b79cedb4b857ce3b389f9063c3c02a5cf5e62715",
   "durationMs": 4640,
   "leadInMs": 350,
   "sentenceStartsMs": [
    0,
    3300
   ],
   "voice": "en-IN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
   "speakingRate": 1,
   "text": "Excess water is lost from the leaves as water vapour. That is transpiration."
  },
  "whole.vacuole": {
   "url": "04_whole_vacuole.mp3",
   "bytes": 13632,
   "sha256": "15bb017d96117b0a61a96c9f8f4d2e682e2e4b526d52e1489537931b1e11e329",
   "durationMs": 4160,
   "leadInMs": 350,
   "sentenceStartsMs": [
    0
   ],
   "voice": "en-IN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
   "speakingRate": 1,
   "text": "Inside the cells, many wastes are stored in vacuoles."
  },
  "whole.leaf": {
   "url": "04_whole_leaf.mp3",
   "bytes": 19104,
   "sha256": "a44eaf0583f7c68c4061ed5c2726b9b6af48cf8d89cc6779ddcc8a0110e8c8ea",
   "durationMs": 4760,
   "leadInMs": 350,
   "sentenceStartsMs": [
    0
   ],
   "voice": "en-IN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
   "speakingRate": 1,
   "text": "Some wastes are stored in leaves, which later fall off and take the wastes with them."
  },
  "whole.xylem": {
   "url": "04_whole_xylem.mp3",
   "bytes": 14496,
   "sha256": "bd29f326dc2f9a9f6c39eec7430e1b33046e22b7efbbf7c94151ac13bb81f571",
   "durationMs": 3800,
   "leadInMs": 350,
   "sentenceStartsMs": [
    0
   ],
   "voice": "en-IN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
   "speakingRate": 1,
   "text": "In the stem, old xylem holds resins and gums."
  },
  "whole.soil": {
   "url": "04_whole_soil.mp3",
   "bytes": 14112,
   "sha256": "44e0bf2767f51c5df72665433b0647fac2f0999bea75968d4799b559c7ae0d1e",
   "durationMs": 3480,
   "leadInMs": 350,
   "sentenceStartsMs": [
    0
   ],
   "voice": "en-IN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
   "speakingRate": 1,
   "text": "Below ground, some wastes are excreted into the soil."
  },
  "whole.answer": {
   "url": "04_whole_answer.mp3",
   "bytes": 45696,
   "sha256": "89498ead960b517957c176f81215b33f67e0b22140d88a8f233b9aa99aac2d86",
   "durationMs": 11120,
   "leadInMs": 350,
   "sentenceStartsMs": [
    0,
    4860
   ],
   "voice": "en-IN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
   "speakingRate": 1,
   "text": "So a plant has no single excretory organ, yet it still deals with its wastes. Some leave as a gas or as vapour, many are stored, some fall away with leaves, and some go into the soil."
  },
  "recall.open": {
   "url": "05_recall_open.mp3",
   "bytes": 22944,
   "sha256": "7697004f133755b3cb380a3bc8dceee74361636eade4bb85058c137f033dde41",
   "durationMs": 6040,
   "leadInMs": 350,
   "sentenceStartsMs": [
    0,
    2240
   ],
   "voice": "en-IN-Chirp3-HD-Aoede",
   "speakingRate": 1,
   "text": "Now it is your turn to remember. Answer from what you have seen, then explain it in your own words."
  }
 },
 "cues": {
  "task.oxygen.try.done": {
